              "badSnippet": "ORDER BY rating",
              "failingInput": "Ratings [9.1, 8.9]",
              "consequence": "Sorts ascending, placing worst movies first (8.9 then 9.1).",
              "howToFix": "Append DESC: ORDER BY rating DESC.",
