              "failingInput": "SalesPerson table",
              "consequence": "Returns John (the only person who sold to RED) instead of Amy, Mark, and Pam.",
              "howToFix": "Use NOT IN instead of IN.",
              "mistake": "Affirmative membership instead of exclusion",
